## Why this suite is legitimately RED before implementation

`test/toast.test.ts` fails to load — `Cannot find module '../src/shared/toast'`
— because the module is created by plan Task 1. For a brand-new pure module
that is the only red available; what carries the discrimination once it
exists is the content of the assertions above (expire ignored for a toast
with an action, suppressed keys, replace-not-queue, stale-key no-ops). The
other 267 cases of the corpus stay green.

No test asserts on an invented internal, a private field or a call count. No
mock and no fake timer: the reducer is pure, so the tests hand it the events
the store would dispatch.

